# The champion with the riposte alone (riposte 1, turtle 0): the whole
# reserve releases the moment an intrusion inside our outpost radius
# ends, with no hold in front of it. The attribution arm the turtle bar
# needs: turtlebar192's turtler arm carries riposte 1 beside the hold,
# and its first cohort read (2026-09-13) put every flipped seed OUTSIDE
# the cohort the hold latches on, which is where only the riposte can
# act. Priced on the same 96 certified seeds so the counter-punch's
# own worth on the champion is read directly, not inferred by
# subtraction. Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's
# exactly.
